{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019ZFmHh6qTtcn6vgmuTdbPv","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_4/projects/trace-verdict-study/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 10\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 16:14 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP pass 阈值统一为 ≥2pp + bootstrap CI 不含 0；补全 kill criteria\\\\n  rationale: IDEA_BRIEF pilot 用 2pp（Defects4J 上下文），ROADMAP 初版用 3pp。考虑到 holdout ~1.3K\\\\n    样本统计功效有限，统一为 2pp + CI 要求。FAIL 后先排查 bug 1 天，clean fail 则 pivot 到 negative-result\\\\n    framing。WEAK PASS 追加 CRUXEval verdict 验证。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 21:50 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 第一轮结果无效：VOTA match 字段泄漏 + full_trace label 截断，需修复后重训\\\\n  rationale: VOTA 99.16% 来自 match=True/False 直接泄漏答案（trivial pattern matching）；full_trace\\\\n    28.4% 来自 label 被 2048 token 截断丢弃。no_trace 75.13% 有效但无法与其他条件对比。修复方案：去 match 字段\\\\n    + 智能截断保留 label。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 01:24 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP PASS — VOTA 95.63% (+20.5pp over no_trace), 附带 actual/expected leakage\\\\n    concern 需 ablation 验证\\\\n  rationale: D001 标准满足：VOTA vs no_trace +20.5pp, 95% CI [+17.7, +23.4] 不含 0。但 >95%\\\\n    触发高准确率警戒，pass_recall 99.8% 暗示模型可能在做 actual==expected 字符串比对而非代码行为理解。进入 research\\\\n    阶段后第一实验必须是去 actual/expected ablation。full_trace 28.49% 为 genuine negative（100%\\\\n    预测 fail，trace token 稀释分类梯度），后续可尝试 label-only loss。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: vota_seed42_v4\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: 95.63% accuracy, +20.5pp lift, PASS\\\\n  - exp_id: no_trace_seed42_v4\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: 75.13% accuracy\\\\n  - exp_id: full_trace_seed42_v2\\\\n    role: negative\\\\n    result: 28.49% accuracy, model collapse\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 01:34 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D004: full_trace 28.4% 系 chat template overhead 导致 label 截断（非 genuine\\\\n    negative），选方案 B + 三条件全部重训 v5'\\\\n  rationale: Agent 诊断发现 format_training_data.py 按 raw tokens 截断到 2048，但 train_sft.py\\\\n    的 Qwen chat template 额外增加 31 tokens → TRL max_length=2048 从右截断 → full_trace 100%\\\\n    pass label 被切 → 全预测 fail。VOTA 也受影响（89.4% pass label 被截），但 360 条足够学到 95.63%。选方案\\\\n    B（根本修复：trace budget 减 32 tokens）+ 三条件全部重训，确保公平对比。这是第三轮修复，必须加 end-to-end 验证：训练前确认\\\\n    0 样本被截断。Claim 2（full traces hurt）暂时搁置，等 v5 结果。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: full_trace_seed42_v2\\\\n    role: invalidated\\\\n    result: 28.49% due to label truncation bug, not genuine negative\\\\n  - exp_id: vota_seed42_v4\\\\n    role: affected\\\\n    result: 95.63% with only 10.6% pass labels intact — may improve after fix\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D003\\\\n- id: D005\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 04:07 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D005: full_trace_v5 确认 81.76%（非 collapse），D004 假说正确。Claim 2 从 \\\\\\\"full traces\\\\n    hurt\\\\\\\" 改为 \\\\\\\"VOTA 显著优于 full_trace (+13.8pp)\\\\\\\"。plan_002 降为 P1。'\\\\n  rationale: v5 修复 chat template overhead 后 full_trace 从 28.4% 恢复到 81.76%（+6.6pp over\\\\n    no_trace），确认 v2 collapse 是截断 bug 非 gradient dilution。三条件梯度：no_trace 75.1% < full_trace\\\\n    81.8% < VOTA 95.6%。Claim 2 reframe 为 \\\\\\\"trace compression 提供更高 information density\\\\\\\"。plan_002\\\\n    (label-only loss) 原假设 (gradient dilution) 已被否定，降为 P1；plan_001 (去 actual/expected)\\\\n    仍是最高优先级。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: full_trace_seed42_v5\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: 81.76% accuracy, +6.6pp over no_trace, confirms D004 truncation fix\\\\n  - exp_id: vota_seed42_v4\\\\n    role: comparison\\\\n    result: 95.63%, +13.8pp over full_trace\\\\n  - exp_id: no_trace_seed42_v4\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: 75.13%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D006\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 04:31 UTC\\\\n  summary: full_trace collapse 根因确认为 chat template overhead bug，非 gradient dilution；v5\\\\n    修复后 accuracy 81.8%\\\\n  rationale: full_trace_v2 的 28.4% accuracy + 100% predict fail collapse 完全由 chat\\\\n    template overhead 导致 pass 样本 label 被截断造成。v5 修复截断后 accuracy 恢复至 81.8%（+6.7pp over\\\\n    no_trace），collapse 完全消除（pass_recall 从 8.5% 恢复至 87%）。三条件形成清晰层次：no_trace 75.1% <\\\\n    full_trace 81.8% < VOTA 95.6%。原 D004 中的 gradient dilution 假说被推翻。plan_002 (label-only\\\\n    loss) 仍保留为 ablation 实验但目的调整：不再验证 collapse 根因，改为测试 loss masking 对 full_trace 的边际提升。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: full_trace_seed42_v2\\\\n    role: 原始实验（含 bug）\\\\n    result: 28.4% accuracy, collapse\\\\n  - exp_id: full_trace_seed42_v5\\\\n    role: 修复后实验\\\\n    result: 81.8% accuracy, collapse 消除\\\\n  - exp_id: vota_seed42_v5\\\\n    role: 对比基准\\\\n    result: 99.16% accuracy\\\\n  - exp_id: no_trace_seed42_v4\\\\n    role: 对比基准\\\\n    result: 75.13% accuracy\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D007\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 06:04 UTC\\\\n  summary: Claim 3 从 element-level 降级为 component-level design principles；ae_only 移至\\\\n    Appendix\\\\n  rationale: ae_only 数据 88% (4159/4720) 为 fallback locals dump 而非干净 actual/expected\\\\n    值（VOTA compressor _extract_assertions() 固有行为）。ae_only 结果无论高低都无法干净归因于 actual/expected。Reviewer\\\\n    评估：三个干净实验（plan_001 减法 + exception_only + loop_only）足以支撑 component-level 归因，但不够\\\\n    element-level。采纳 Reviewer Option A：主表报告 plan_001 + exception_only + loop_only，ae_only\\\\n    移 Appendix 附 caveat。Claim 1/2 不受影响。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_003\\\\n    role: component ablation (ae_only/exception_only/loop_only)\\\\n    result: ae_only 88% fallback 污染\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_001\\\\n    role: 主线证据 (减法验证 ae 贡献)\\\\n    result: RUNNING\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D006\\\\n- id: D008\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 06:23 UTC\\\\n  summary: plan_001 确认 actual/expected 不是 VOTA 效果来源；Claim 1 走 genuine behavioral understanding\\\\n    路径\\\\n  rationale: vota_no_ae (去除 actual/expected) accuracy 99.41% vs VOTA 完整版 99.16%，差异仅\\\\n    3 样本/1190（不显著），去 ae 后不降反微升。exception + loop + assertion structure 足以实现近完美 verdict\\\\n    预测。Claim 1 contingency 中 \\\\\\\"trivial string comparison\\\\\\\" 假说被否定。Reviewer 同时指出 trace\\\\n    结构性信号（[No trace available]→fail, [ERROR]→fail, [ASSERT]+[LOOP]→pass）可能构成 trivial\\\\n    pattern，但此问题对所有 VOTA 变体等同存在，不影响 plan_001 结论。exception_only ablation (plan_003\\\\n    sub-b) 将量化 [ERROR] 信号贡献。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: vota_no_ae_seed42\\\\n    role: plan_001 ablation\\\\n    result: 99.41% accuracy, 7 errors/1190\\\\n  - exp_id: vota_seed42_v5\\\\n    role: 对照基准\\\\n    result: 99.16% accuracy, 10 errors/1190\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D006\\\\n  - D007\\\\n- id: D009\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 07:58 UTC\\\\n  summary: plan_002 确认 gradient dilution 是 real 但 minor factor (4.5pp/17.4pp=26%)；information\\\\n    overload 是 VOTA 优势主因 (74%)\\\\n  rationale: full_trace label-only loss 86.2% vs 标准 loss 81.8%，提升 4.5pp 确认 gradient\\\\n    dilution 存在。但 86.2% vs VOTA 99.2% 仍有 13pp gap，只能通过 trace compression 弥补。因果分解：gradient\\\\n    dilution 贡献 ~26% (4.5/17.4pp)，information overload 贡献 ~74% (13.0/17.4pp)。VOTA\\\\n    的核心优势是信息质量（decision-relevant state selection），不仅是训练效率。这为 Claim 2 提供了定量支撑，可在论文中写\\\\\\\"Even\\\\n    with oracle loss masking, full traces still underperform VOTA by 13pp\\\\\\\"。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: full_trace_label_only_seed42\\\\n    role: plan_002 ablation\\\\n    result: 86.2% accuracy [84.4, 88.1]\\\\n  - exp_id: full_trace_seed42_v5\\\\n    role: 对照 (standard loss)\\\\n    result: 81.8%\\\\n  - exp_id: vota_seed42_v5\\\\n    role: 对照 (VOTA)\\\\n    result: 99.2%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D006\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 6667, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01J23vJdzHVYLeAF8K3aY5zr","session_id":"f8be9c78-f712-42a3-a09c-05adddba0d90","uuid":"ec649aae-9b7b-49d0-8664-7c72d18b6297","timestamp":"2026-05-15T09:34:17.827Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_012pXnzoFfsnEj5DgwDMA2fc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01XbtrHw3SwLBEh4Ne5qepZX","name":"mcp__agent-ml-research__read_project_file","input":{"project":"trace-verdict-study","file":"memory.md","max_chars":0},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4825,"cache_read_input_tokens":16914,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4825,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":52,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01J23vJdzHVYLeAF8K3aY5zr","session_id":"f8be9c78-f712-42a3-a09c-05adddba0d90","uuid":"9b24c7c7-384a-49b3-a74d-4f3a5147b315"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XbtrHw3SwLBEh4Ne5qepZX","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_4/projects/trace-verdict-study/memory.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# trace-verdict-study Memory\\\\n\\\\n## MVP Round 1 结论（已作废）[2026-05-14]\\\\n\\\\nRound 1 结果全部无效，原因：\\\\n1. **VOTA match 泄漏**：assertion output 中 `match=True/False` 直接泄漏 verdict，99.2% accuracy 是 pattern matching 而非理解 trace\\\\n2. **Label 截断**：full_trace 28.4% 是因为 label 在序列末尾被 tokenizer 截断，模型根本没学到正确标签\\\\n\\\\n### 教训\\\\n- VOTA 输出中任何直接或间接暴露 pass/fail 的字段都是 data leakage——审查 trace format 时需要\\\\\\\"如果模型只看这一个字段能否猜到答案\\\\\\\"的测试\\\\n- 训练数据格式化必须保证 label 不被截断——应先预留 label token budget，再分配 trace 空间\\\\n- `[No trace available - execution failed]` 这类文本也是隐性泄漏（暗示 fail）\\\\n\\\\n## MVP v5 + Ablation 结果（当前有效数据）[2026-05-15]\\\\n\\\\n### 三条件对比（全部 v5 代码版本，统一 bootstrap CI）\\\\n- no_trace v5: 75.1% [72.8, 77.5], lift +3.6pp over majority\\\\n- **full_trace v5: 81.8%** [79.7, 83.9], lift +6.6pp [4.4, 9.0] vs no_trace\\\\n- **VOTA v5: 99.2%** [98.6, 99.7], lift +24.3pp [21.8, 26.8] vs no_trace\\\\n- **VOTA vs full_trace: +17.7pp** [15.5, 19.8]（所有对比 p < 0.001）\\\\n\\\\n### plan_001 ablation: VOTA w/o actual/expected [2026-05-15]\\\\n- **accuracy 99.4%** [98.9, 99.8] — 去掉 actual/expected 后性能不降反微升（vs VOTA v5 99.2%）\\\\n- **结论：actual/expected 字段是冗余信息**，VOTA 效果来自 trace 行为模式（调用序列、变量变化、exception 等）的理解\\\\n- Claim 1 走 **full positive framing**: \\\\\\\"VOTA teaches execution-grounded verdict reasoning\\\\\\\"\\\\n- 这排除了 \\\\\\\"VOTA 只是做 actual==expected 字符串匹配\\\\\\\" 的 trivial explanation\\\\n\\\\n### plan_002 ablation: label-only loss on full_trace [2026-05-15]\\\\n- **accuracy 86.2%** [84.4, 88.1] — 比标准 full_trace v5 (81.8%) 提升 +4.5pp\\\\n- **label-only loss 部分缓解了 gradient dilution**：标准 loss 在 ~2000 trace tokens 上计算梯度导致分类信号被稀释，label-only 只在 pass/fail token 上计算 loss\\\\n- **但仍远低于 VOTA (99.2%)**：86.2% vs 99.2% = 13pp gap 不可用训练目标优化弥补\\\\n- **结论：full_trace-VOTA gap 的主因是 information overload（trace 噪声），不是 gradient dilution**\\\\n  - gradient dilution 贡献: ~4.5pp（可通过 label-only loss 修复）\\\\n  - information overload 贡献: ~13pp（只能通过 trace compression 修复）\\\\n- 这强化 Claim 2: VOTA 的优势不仅是训练效率（loss 信号更集中），更是信息质量（只保留 decision-relevant 状态）\\\\n- train_loss 0.2505（比标准 full_trace 的 0.05 高 5x）——符合预期：label-only loss 只在 1-2 tokens 上计算，loss 自然更高\\\\n\\\\n### 关键结论修正 [2026-05-15]\\\\n- **v2 full_trace 28.4% 不是 genuine negative，不是 gradient dilution**\\\\n- 根因完全是 chat template overhead bug：format 按 raw 2048 截断，训练时 chat template +31 tokens → TRL 右截断切掉 label\\\\n- v5 修复后 accuracy 从 28.4% → 81.8%（+53.4pp），collapse 完全消除\\\\n- **full trace 对 verdict 有显著 lift (+6.6pp over no_trace)**，但 VOTA 更优（+17.7pp）\\\\n\\\\n## ae_only fallback 污染 [2026-05-15]\\\\n\\\\n- **plan_003 ae_only 数据中 88% (4159/4720) 样本的 actual/expected 字段是 `[fallback: full locals]`**（全量局部变量 dump），源自 VOTA compressor `_extract_assertions()` 固有行为，非 data prep bug\\\\n- ae_only 测的是\\\\\\\"assertion 事件（含 locals noise）\\\\\\\"而非纯 actual/expected 信号\\\\n- **plan_001（减法：去掉 ae）是验证 ae 贡献的更可靠证据**——不受 fallback 影响\\\\n- 论文讨论 ae_only 结果时**必须披露** fallback 污染比率\\\\n- 不需要新增 ae_clean_only condition（优先级太低）\\\\n\\\\n## 管线教训 [2026-05-14]\\\\n\\\\n### VOTA assertion snapshots 必须捕获 test 帧\\\\n- sys.settrace 的帧过滤不能只捕获 `<solution>` 文件——assert 语句在 `<test>` 文件中执行\\\\n\\\\n### exception 事件格式必须统一\\\\n- trace collector 与 VOTA 之间约定：`{\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\": str, \\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\": str}`\\\\n\\\\n### prompt 必须包含 test code（控制变量）\\\\n- 所有条件的 prompt 都必须包含 test code，性能差异应严格归因于 execution trace 本身\\\\n\\\\n### TRL 版本注意\\\\n- TRL 1.1.0 已将 `max_seq_length` 重命名为 `max_length`\\\\n\\\\n## 环境信息 [2026-05-14]\\\\n- westd-11235: 2x RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell 94GB, CUDA 12.8\\\\n- 模型通过 ModelScope CDN 下载（HuggingFace 太慢 ~1.3MB/s)\\\\n- \\\\\\\"pass\\\\\\\"/\\\\\\\"fail\\\\\\\" 在 Qwen2.5-Coder tokenizer 中均为单 token (6385/18403)\\\\n- Qwen2.5-Coder chat template overhead: 31 tokens\\\\n\\\\n## 流程教训\\\\n- submit_training_job 必须用，不能用 nohup——否则无监控无回调\\\\n- Worker 汇报\\\\\\\"实验失败\\\\\\\"需要交叉验证（exit code + log），曾出现误报\\\\n- 提交前先检查是否已有同条件实验在跑，避免重复提交产生遗留\\\\n- [2026-05-15] submit_training_job 提交时 --gpu 参数必须与 gpu_ids 对应的物理 GPU 一致，否则 OOM 撞卡\\\\n- [2026-05-15] 数据格式化 token budget 必须扣除 chat template overhead，否则训练时 TRL 右截断会切掉 label\\\\n- [2026-05-15] 旧 eval_results.json 可能残留在 checkpoint 目录中——始终以最新 bootstrap_compare.json 为准\\\\n- [2026-05-15] 训练 eval (eval_results.json in checkpoint) 与 test eval (bootstrap_compare.json) 可能差异很大——前者是训练集 eval split，后者才是真实 test accuracy\\\\n- [2026-05-15] **分析 Worker 报告的 metrics 必须交叉验证**：确认 eval_results.json/bootstrap_compare.json 在服务器上存在，不要盲信 Worker 报告的数字\\\\n- [2026-05-15] **所有训练必须加 --gradient_checkpointing**：两次 OOM（plan_002 首次、plan_003 exception_only 首次）均因缺此 flag。RTX PRO 6000 98GB 对 7B 模型 full fine-tune 不够，gradient checkpointing 是必需项，不是可选优化\\\\n\\\\n## 文献定位 [2026-05-15]\\\\n- Wang et al. (EMNLP 2025): 原始 trace 对 SFT 帮助有限 → 支持 VOTA \\\\\\\"需要压缩\\\\\\\" 的动机\\\\n- APPT (TSE 2024): 最近 competitor，79.7% patch correctness accuracy，BERT 非 decoder，无 trace\\\\n- **文献空白**：无现有工作做 compressed execution trace + SFT for binary verdict\\\\n- Ferrando et al. 2025 (scratchpad): compact scratchpad（仅变化量）≥ regular（全部值），直接印证 actual/expected 冗余\\\\n- TraceCoder (ICSE 2026): 选择性 probe 优于全量 trace，Pass@1 +34.43%\\\\n- TraceRepair (2026): critical variable snapshots > 全量，392 缺陷修复\\\\n- Demystifying Errors (2025): LLM 值追踪能力弱，解释了\\\\\\\"为什么值冗余\\\\\\\"的机制\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 4677, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01J23vJdzHVYLeAF8K3aY5zr","session_id":"f8be9c78-f712-42a3-a09c-05adddba0d90","uuid":"3f014522-5411-4813-9cd5-7351c6d74e37","timestamp":"2026-05-15T09:34:21.323Z"}
