{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013zWDt1bYz47at1YKno81c8","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_4/projects/trace-verdict-study/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# trace-verdict-study — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-15 04:36 UTC | 更新原因: Reviewer WARNING 修正: VOTA 统一为 v5(99.2%), plan_002 降 P1, 增 no_trace_v5 补跑任务, gradient dilution 表述修正\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\n验证 trace SFT 在 code verdict 任务（二分类 pass/fail）上的效果与 trace 粒度的关系。Core Insight: verdict tasks 需要 decision-relevant state snapshots (VOTA)，不需要完整执行模拟；trace 粒度必须匹配任务输出复杂度。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- **阶段**: Research（MVP 于 2026-05-15 通过，D003）\\\\n- **三条件层次已建立 (D006)**（v5 代码版本，除 no_trace 待补跑）:\\\\n  - no_trace v4: 75.1% (baseline; **v5 待补跑以统一代码版本**)\\\\n  - full_trace v5: **81.8%** (+6.7pp over no_trace_v4，collapse 已修复，根因为 chat template bug)\\\\n  - VOTA v5: **99.2%** (+24.0pp over no_trace_v4; eval_results.json=0.9916，registry 待修正)\\\\n- **关键风险**: VOTA >99% 可能为 actual/expected 字符串比对 → plan_001 正在验证\\\\n- **投稿目标**: EMNLP 2026 ARR, deadline May 25（10 天）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [x] full_trace collapse 根因确认 (chat template bug, D006)\\\\n- [ ] plan_001 (去 actual/expected ablation) — cuda:1 训练中，ETA ~06:17 UTC → 决定 Claim 1 强度\\\\n- [ ] cuda:0 孤儿显存释放（紧急指令已发，第 3 次 critical）→ 释放后启动 plan_002\\\\n- [ ] plan_002 (label-only loss ablation, **P1**) — 测试 loss masking 能否进一步提升 full_trace 81.8%，兼探 gradient dilution 是否是 full_trace-VOTA gap 的部分原因\\\\n- [ ] vota_v5 registry metrics 修正（0.9941→0.9916，以 eval_results.json 为准）\\\\n- [ ] **no_trace_v5 补跑**（plan_001 完成后 cuda:1 空出时，~20min）— 统一三条件代码版本\\\\n- [ ] plan_001 结论出来后 → 启动 plan_003（component ablation，P0，~8h）\\\\n- [ ] 根据 ablation 结果决定是否需要 plan_004/005（P1，second model/task）\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- westd-11235: cuda:0, cuda:1（2× RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell 98GB）\\\\n- 当前状态：cuda:1 跑 plan_001; cuda:0 孤儿显存待释放后跑 plan_002\\\\n- Research 阶段预算：P0 ~14h, P1 ~20h, P2 ~7h，总计 ~46h（~23h wall-clock）\\\\n- 时间充裕：10 天 × 2 卡 = 480 GPU-h 可用\\\\n\\\\n## 实验计划摘要（详见 experiment_plan.yaml）\\\\n| Priority | ID | Description | GPU-h | Status |\\\\n|----------|----------|-------------|-------|--------|\\\\n| P0 | plan_001 | 去 actual/expected ablation | 3 | **RUNNING (cuda:1)** |\\\\n| **P1** | plan_002 | full_trace label-only loss (ablation) | 3 | 待 cuda:0 释放 |\\\\n| P0 | plan_003 | VOTA component ablation (4 conditions) | 8 | planned (依赖 plan_001) |\\\\n| P1 | plan_004 | DeepSeek-Coder 复现 | 6 | planned |\\\\n| P1 | plan_005 | 第二 verdict task (DebugBench/Defects4J) | 6 | planned |\\\\n| P1 | plan_006 | Trace length ablation | 8 | planned |\\\\n| P2 | plan_007 | Calibration analysis (ECE) | 1 | planned |\\\\n| P2 | plan_008 | Seed robustness (3 seeds) | 6 | planned |\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D009 | 2026-05-15 | plan_002 确认 gradient dilution 是 real 但 minor facto | full_trace_label_only_seed42, full_trace_seed42_v5, vota_seed42_v5 |\\\\n| D008 | 2026-05-15 | plan_001 确认 actual/expected 不是 VOTA 效果来源；Claim 1 走 | vota_no_ae_seed42, vota_seed42_v5 |\\\\n| D007 | 2026-05-15 | Claim 3 从 element-level 降级为 component-level design | plan_003, plan_001 |\\\\n| D006 | 2026-05-15 | full_trace collapse 根因确认为 chat template overhead b | full_trace_seed42_v2, full_trace_seed42_v5, vota_seed42_v5, no_trace_seed42_v4 |\\\\n| D005 | 2026-05-15 | D005: full_trace_v5 确认 81.76%（非 collapse），D004 假说正 | full_trace_seed42_v5, vota_seed42_v4, no_trace_seed42_v4 |\\\\n| D004 | 2026-05-15 | D004: full_trace 28.4% 系 chat template overhead 导致 | full_trace_seed42_v2, vota_seed42_v4 |\\\\n| D003 | 2026-05-15 | MVP PASS — VOTA 95.63% (+20.5pp over no_trace), 附带 | vota_seed42_v4, no_trace_seed42_v4, full_trace_seed42_v2 |\\\\n| D002 | 2026-05-14 | MVP 第一轮结果无效：VOTA match 字段泄漏 + full_trace label 截断， | — |\\\\n| D001 | 2026-05-14 | MVP pass 阈值统一为 ≥2pp + bootstrap CI 不含 0；补全 kill cr | — |\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3466, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01J23vJdzHVYLeAF8K3aY5zr","session_id":"f8be9c78-f712-42a3-a09c-05adddba0d90","uuid":"36cb8856-424f-4410-a0f2-ed822c8ddc35","timestamp":"2026-05-15T09:34:25.231Z"}
