{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019U9V8NyurNJ7wqRhcvzXb6","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_4/projects/trace-verdict-study/literature_map.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"categories:\\\\n  execution-trace-llm:\\\\n    description: \\\\\\\"Execution trace 辅助 LLM 代码理解/调试/推理\\\\\\\"\\\\n    papers:\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"NExT: Teaching Large Language Models to Reason about Code Execution\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Ansong Ni, Miltiadis Allamanis, et al. (Google DeepMind)\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2024\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"ICML 2024\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: method-component\\\\n        key_finding: \\\\\\\"自训练在 execution trace 上做 CoT rationale，程序修复 fix rate 在 MBPP +26.1%、HumanEval +14.3%。模型可泛化到无 trace 的场景。\\\\\\\"\\\\n        metrics:\\\\n          mbpp_fix_rate_improvement: \\\\\\\"+26.1%\\\\\\\"\\\\n          humaneval_fix_rate_improvement: \\\\\\\"+14.3%\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"Do Code Semantics Help? A Comprehensive Study on Execution Trace-Based Information for Code LLMs\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Jian Wang, Xiaofei Xie, Qiang Hu, Shangqing Liu, Yi Li\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2025\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"Findings of EMNLP 2025\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: direct-competitor\\\\n        key_finding: \\\\\\\"综合研究发现 execution trace 对 SFT 和 test-time scaling 的帮助有限，与先前工作结论相左。提出 trace adapter 做格式化。这是 VOTA 必须回应的关键负面结果——说明原始 trace 不够，需要针对性压缩/抽象。\\\\\\\"\\\\n        metrics: {}\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"Code Execution as Grounded Supervision for LLM Reasoning\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Dongwon Jung, Wenxuan Zhou, Muhao Chen\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2025\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"EMNLP 2025\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: method-component\\\\n        key_finding: \\\\\\\"用 Python debugger (Snoop) 提取 step-by-step execution trace，转换为自然语言 CoT。训练后模型推理能力提升且生成更少 token（减少 overthinking），具备跨域迁移能力。\\\\\\\"\\\\n        metrics: {}\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"What I cannot execute, I do not understand: Training and Evaluating LLMs on Program Execution Traces\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Lorenzo Ferrando, Nicola Ferraro, et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2025\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv 2503.05703\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: method-component\\\\n        key_finding: \\\\\\\"对比 regular/compact/dynamic 三种 scratchpad 策略，compact（仅记录变化变量）略优于 regular（全部变量值）。CruxEval/MBPP ~80%。直接支持 plan_001：完整值信息冗余，精简不损失效果。\\\\\\\"\\\\n        metrics:\\\\n          cruxeval_accuracy: \\\\\\\"~80%\\\\\\\"\\\\n          mbpp_accuracy: \\\\\\\"~80%\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"Demystifying Errors in LLM Reasoning Traces: An Empirical Study of Code Execution Simulation\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"arXiv 2512.00215\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2025\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: evaluation\\\\n        key_finding: \\\\\\\"LLM 在循环中频繁遗漏/多算变量修改，函数返回值预测不准。说明 LLM 对具体值追踪能力弱于结构理解，为 plan_001 发现（值冗余）提供机制解释。\\\\\\\"\\\\n        metrics: {}\\\\n\\\\n  code-verdict:\\\\n    description: \\\\\\\"LLM 判断代码 pass/fail、正确性分类、mutation testing\\\\\\\"\\\\n    papers:\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"APPT: Boosting Automated Patch Correctness Prediction via Fine-tuning Pre-trained Models\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"iSEngLab (Nanjing University)\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2024\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"IEEE TSE 2024\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: direct-competitor\\\\n        key_finding: \\\\\\\"BERT + LSTM + classifier 微调做 patch 正确性二分类。在 1183 个 Defects4J patches 上 accuracy 79.7%、recall 83.2%，优于 CACHE。与 VOTA 的 verdict 分类目标最接近。\\\\\\\"\\\\n        metrics:\\\\n          accuracy: \\\\\\\"79.7%\\\\\\\"\\\\n          recall: \\\\\\\"83.2%\\\\\\\"\\\\n          f1_improvement_from_finetuning: \\\\\\\"+10.22%\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"Calibration and Correctness of Language Models for Code\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Claudio Spiess, David Gros, et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2025\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"ICSE 2025\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: evaluation\\\\n        key_finding: \\\\\\\"代码生成模型的置信度校准普遍较差。Platt scaling 可改善但需要先验正确性数据。对 VOTA 的启示：verdict 分类需关注校准，不只是准确率。\\\\\\\"\\\\n        metrics: {}\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"Mutation-Guided LLM-based Test Generation at Meta\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Christopher Foster et al. (Meta)\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2025\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"FSE 2025 (Industry)\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: evaluation\\\\n        key_finding: \\\\\\\"LLM equivalence detector 判断 mutant 是否等价，加简单预处理后 precision 0.95、recall 0.96。大规模部署到 10K+ 类，工程师接受率 73%。展示了 LLM 做代码正确性判断的工业可行性。\\\\\\\"\\\\n        metrics:\\\\n          precision: \\\\\\\"0.95\\\\\\\"\\\\n          recall: \\\\\\\"0.96\\\\\\\"\\\\n          classes_evaluated: \\\\\\\"10795\\\\\\\"\\\\n          test_acceptance_rate: \\\\\\\"73%\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  trace-compression:\\\\n    description: \\\\\\\"Execution trace 的压缩、摘要、抽象方法\\\\\\\"\\\\n    papers:\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"Predictive Program Slicing via Execution Knowledge-Guided Dynamic Dependence Learning\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Aashish Yadavally, Yi Li, Tien Nguyen\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2024\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"FSE 2024\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: method-component\\\\n        key_finding: \\\\\\\"ND-Slicer 用 execution-aware 预训练学习动态依赖，无需实际执行即可预测特定输入的程序切片。Python 上 exact-match 81.31%、ROUGE-LCS 0.954。与 VOTA 的 assertion-point snapshots 思路类似——都是从完整 trace 中提取关键信息。\\\\\\\"\\\\n        metrics:\\\\n          exact_match: \\\\\\\"81.31%\\\\\\\"\\\\n          rouge_lcs: \\\\\\\"0.954\\\\\\\"\\\\n          fault_localization_accuracy: \\\\\\\"63.88%\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"Towards Effectively Leveraging Execution Traces for Program Repair with Code LLMs\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Mirazul Haque, Petr Babkin, et al. (J.P. Morgan AI Research)\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2025\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"KnowledgeNLP Workshop @ ACL 2025\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: background\\\\n        key_finding: \\\\\\\"直接将 execution trace 加入 prompt 帮助有限，且随 trace 复杂度增加效果递减。LLM 优化的 prompt 格式比原始 trace 更一致地优于无 trace baseline。直接支持 VOTA 的核心假设：原始 trace 太冗长，需要专门的压缩/抽象。\\\\\\\"\\\\n        metrics: {}\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"Making LLMs Program Interpreters via Execution Trace Chain of Thought (ET-CoT)\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"ICML 2025 Workshop PRAL\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2025\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"ICML 2025 Workshop\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: method-component\\\\n        key_finding: \\\\\\\"开发 PyTracify 工具生成 sub-line 粒度的结构化 execution trace，SFT 后 Qwen2.5-7B 在 CRUXEval-O 达 70.0%、LiveCodeBench 达 88.3%，超过同规模 code-oriented 模型。其 trace 格式本身是一种 trace abstraction。\\\\\\\"\\\\n        metrics:\\\\n          cruxeval_o: \\\\\\\"70.0%\\\\\\\"\\\\n          livecodebench_execution: \\\\\\\"88.3%\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"TraceCoder: A Trace-Driven Multi-Agent Framework for Automated Debugging of LLM-Generated Code\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"ICSE 2026 Research Track\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2026\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"ICSE 2026\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: background\\\\n        key_finding: \\\\\\\"在特定位置插入 diagnostic probes 而非全量 trace 记录，Pass@1 提升 34.43%。选择性 trace 采集优于全量，支持 VOTA 的行为模式抽象思路。\\\\\\\"\\\\n        metrics:\\\\n          pass_at_1_improvement: \\\\\\\"+34.43%\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"Runtime Execution Traces Guided Automated Program Repair with Multi-Agent Debate\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Jiaqing Wu et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2026\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv 2604.02647\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: background\\\\n        key_finding: \\\\\\\"Probe agent 选择性捕获 critical variables 的 execution snapshots 用于 multi-agent repair debate，修复 392 个缺陷。验证了选择性 trace 信息优于全量记录。\\\\\\\"\\\\n        metrics:\\\\n          defects_fixed: \\\\\\\"392\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  sft-classification:\\\\n    description: \\\\\\\"用 SFT 做分类任务的方法论和 findings\\\\\\\"\\\\n    papers:\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"Fine-Tuning Causal LLMs for Text Classification: Embedding-Based vs. Instruction-Based Approaches\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Amirhossein Yousefiramandi, Ciaran Cooney\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2025\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv 2512.12677\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: method-component\\\\n        key_finding: \\\\\\\"对比 embedding-based（加分类头）vs instruction-based（prompt->response）两种 SFT 分类方式。Embedding-based + QLoRA 在 F1 上与 instruction-tuned 持平，但可训练参数少得多。对 VOTA 的 verdict 分类有直接参考价值——选哪种 SFT 格式。\\\\\\\"\\\\n        metrics: {}\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"FisherSFT: Data-Efficient Supervised Fine-Tuning of Language Models Using Information Gain\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Rohan Deb, Kiran Koshy Thekumparampil, et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2025\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"ICML 2025\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: background\\\\n        key_finding: \\\\\\\"用 Fisher 信息矩阵选择信息量最大的训练样本子集，通过 last-layer 线性化高效近似。在固定数据预算下提升 SFT 效果。对 VOTA 的数据选择策略有参考价值。\\\\\\\"\\\\n        metrics: {}\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"Fine-Tuned 'Small' LLMs (Still) Significantly Outperform Zero-Shot Generative AI Models in Text Classification\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Martin Juan Jose Bucher, Marco Martini\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2024\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv 2406.08660\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: background\\\\n        key_finding: \\\\\\\"跨多种分类任务（情感、立场、情绪等），fine-tuned 小模型全面优于 GPT-4/Claude 的 zero-shot。验证了 VOTA 用 SFT 做 verdict 分类的基本假设——fine-tuning 在分类上优于 prompting。\\\\\\\"\\\\n        metrics: {}\\\\n\\\\nmeta:\\\\n  last_updated: \\\\\\\"2026-05-15\\\\\\\"\\\\n  total_papers: 16\\\\n  search_scope: \\\\\\\"2024-2026, top ML/NLP/SE venues\\\\\\\"\\\\n  key_gaps:\\\\n    - \\\\\\\"缺少直接将 execution trace 用于 binary verdict (pass/fail) 的工作——VOTA 填补此空白\\\\\\\"\\\\n    - \\\\\\\"trace compression 文献多在 distributed systems 或 formal verification 领域，code-level trace 压缩给 LLM 用的工作极少\\\\\\\"\\\\n    - \\\\\\\"SFT for classification 研究多在 NLP 文本分类，code verdict 场景的 SFT 方法论研究接近空白\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 7824, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01WoQB7zaUMw2u55LZvwD1Mc","session_id":"f8be9c78-f712-42a3-a09c-05adddba0d90","uuid":"ba7cce87-ff1e-4184-bc7b-8165bb41b399","timestamp":"2026-05-15T09:34:40.139Z"}
