{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FtpPQVMXF12NpX1v4mwt1y","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_4/projects/trace-verdict-study/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 10\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 16:14 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP pass 阈值统一为 ≥2pp + bootstrap CI 不含 0；补全 kill criteria\\\\n  rationale: IDEA_BRIEF pilot 用 2pp（Defects4J 上下文），ROADMAP 初版用 3pp。考虑到 holdout ~1.3K\\\\n    样本统计功效有限，统一为 2pp + CI 要求。FAIL 后先排查 bug 1 天，clean fail 则 pivot 到 negative-result\\\\n    framing。WEAK PASS 追加 CRUXEval verdict 验证。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 21:50 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 第一轮结果无效：VOTA match 字段泄漏 + full_trace label 截断，需修复后重训\\\\n  rationale: VOTA 99.16% 来自 match=True/False 直接泄漏答案（trivial pattern matching）；full_trace\\\\n    28.4% 来自 label 被 2048 token 截断丢弃。no_trace 75.13% 有效但无法与其他条件对比。修复方案：去 match 字段\\\\n    + 智能截断保留 label。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 01:24 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP PASS — VOTA 95.63% (+20.5pp over no_trace), 附带 actual/expected leakage\\\\n    concern 需 ablation 验证\\\\n  rationale: D001 标准满足：VOTA vs no_trace +20.5pp, 95% CI [+17.7, +23.4] 不含 0。但 >95%\\\\n    触发高准确率警戒，pass_recall 99.8% 暗示模型可能在做 actual==expected 字符串比对而非代码行为理解。进入 research\\\\n    阶段后第一实验必须是去 actual/expected ablation。full_trace 28.49% 为 genuine negative（100%\\\\n    预测 fail，trace token 稀释分类梯度），后续可尝试 label-only loss。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: vota_seed42_v4\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: 95.63% accuracy, +20.5pp lift, PASS\\\\n  - exp_id: no_trace_seed42_v4\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: 75.13% accuracy\\\\n  - exp_id: full_trace_seed42_v2\\\\n    role: negative\\\\n    result: 28.49% accuracy, model collapse\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 01:34 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D004: full_trace 28.4% 系 chat template overhead 导致 label 截断（非 genuine\\\\n    negative），选方案 B + 三条件全部重训 v5'\\\\n  rationale: Agent 诊断发现 format_training_data.py 按 raw tokens 截断到 2048，但 train_sft.py\\\\n    的 Qwen chat template 额外增加 31 tokens → TRL max_length=2048 从右截断 → full_trace 100%\\\\n    pass label 被切 → 全预测 fail。VOTA 也受影响（89.4% pass label 被截），但 360 条足够学到 95.63%。选方案\\\\n    B（根本修复：trace budget 减 32 tokens）+ 三条件全部重训，确保公平对比。这是第三轮修复，必须加 end-to-end 验证：训练前确认\\\\n    0 样本被截断。Claim 2（full traces hurt）暂时搁置，等 v5 结果。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: full_trace_seed42_v2\\\\n    role: invalidated\\\\n    result: 28.49% due to label truncation bug, not genuine negative\\\\n  - exp_id: vota_seed42_v4\\\\n    role: affected\\\\n    result: 95.63% with only 10.6% pass labels intact — may improve after fix\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D003\\\\n- id: D005\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 04:07 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D005: full_trace_v5 确认 81.76%（非 collapse），D004 假说正确。Claim 2 从 \\\\\\\"full traces\\\\n    hurt\\\\\\\" 改为 \\\\\\\"VOTA 显著优于 full_trace (+13.8pp)\\\\\\\"。plan_002 降为 P1。'\\\\n  rationale: v5 修复 chat template overhead 后 full_trace 从 28.4% 恢复到 81.76%（+6.6pp over\\\\n    no_trace），确认 v2 collapse 是截断 bug 非 gradient dilution。三条件梯度：no_trace 75.1% < full_trace\\\\n    81.8% < VOTA 95.6%。Claim 2 reframe 为 \\\\\\\"trace compression 提供更高 information density\\\\\\\"。plan_002\\\\n    (label-only loss) 原假设 (gradient dilution) 已被否定，降为 P1；plan_001 (去 actual/expected)\\\\n    仍是最高优先级。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: full_trace_seed42_v5\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: 81.76% accuracy, +6.6pp over no_trace, confirms D004 truncation fix\\\\n  - exp_id: vota_seed42_v4\\\\n    role: comparison\\\\n    result: 95.63%, +13.8pp over full_trace\\\\n  - exp_id: no_trace_seed42_v4\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: 75.13%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D006\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 04:31 UTC\\\\n  summary: full_trace collapse 根因确认为 chat template overhead bug，非 gradient dilution；v5\\\\n    修复后 accuracy 81.8%\\\\n  rationale: full_trace_v2 的 28.4% accuracy + 100% predict fail collapse 完全由 chat\\\\n    template overhead 导致 pass 样本 label 被截断造成。v5 修复截断后 accuracy 恢复至 81.8%（+6.7pp over\\\\n    no_trace），collapse 完全消除（pass_recall 从 8.5% 恢复至 87%）。三条件形成清晰层次：no_trace 75.1% <\\\\n    full_trace 81.8% < VOTA 95.6%。原 D004 中的 gradient dilution 假说被推翻。plan_002 (label-only\\\\n    loss) 仍保留为 ablation 实验但目的调整：不再验证 collapse 根因，改为测试 loss masking 对 full_trace 的边际提升。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: full_trace_seed42_v2\\\\n    role: 原始实验（含 bug）\\\\n    result: 28.4% accuracy, collapse\\\\n  - exp_id: full_trace_seed42_v5\\\\n    role: 修复后实验\\\\n    result: 81.8% accuracy, collapse 消除\\\\n  - exp_id: vota_seed42_v5\\\\n    role: 对比基准\\\\n    result: 99.16% accuracy\\\\n  - exp_id: no_trace_seed42_v4\\\\n    role: 对比基准\\\\n    result: 75.13% accuracy\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D007\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 06:04 UTC\\\\n  summary: Claim 3 从 element-level 降级为 component-level design principles；ae_only 移至\\\\n    Appendix\\\\n  rationale: ae_only 数据 88% (4159/4720) 为 fallback locals dump 而非干净 actual/expected\\\\n    值（VOTA compressor _extract_assertions() 固有行为）。ae_only 结果无论高低都无法干净归因于 actual/expected。Reviewer\\\\n    评估：三个干净实验（plan_001 减法 + exception_only + loop_only）足以支撑 component-level 归因，但不够\\\\n    element-level。采纳 Reviewer Option A：主表报告 plan_001 + exception_only + loop_only，ae_only\\\\n    移 Appendix 附 caveat。Claim 1/2 不受影响。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_003\\\\n    role: component ablation (ae_only/exception_only/loop_only)\\\\n    result: ae_only 88% fallback 污染\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_001\\\\n    role: 主线证据 (减法验证 ae 贡献)\\\\n    result: RUNNING\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D006\\\\n- id: D008\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 06:23 UTC\\\\n  summary: plan_001 确认 actual/expected 不是 VOTA 效果来源；Claim 1 走 genuine behavioral understanding\\\\n    路径\\\\n  rationale: vota_no_ae (去除 actual/expected) accuracy 99.41% vs VOTA 完整版 99.16%，差异仅\\\\n    3 样本/1190（不显著），去 ae 后不降反微升。exception + loop + assertion structure 足以实现近完美 verdict\\\\n    预测。Claim 1 contingency 中 \\\\\\\"trivial string comparison\\\\\\\" 假说被否定。Reviewer 同时指出 trace\\\\n    结构性信号（[No trace available]→fail, [ERROR]→fail, [ASSERT]+[LOOP]→pass）可能构成 trivial\\\\n    pattern，但此问题对所有 VOTA 变体等同存在，不影响 plan_001 结论。exception_only ablation (plan_003\\\\n    sub-b) 将量化 [ERROR] 信号贡献。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: vota_no_ae_seed42\\\\n    role: plan_001 ablation\\\\n    result: 99.41% accuracy, 7 errors/1190\\\\n  - exp_id: vota_seed42_v5\\\\n    role: 对照基准\\\\n    result: 99.16% accuracy, 10 errors/1190\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D006\\\\n  - D007\\\\n- id: D009\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 07:58 UTC\\\\n  summary: plan_002 确认 gradient dilution 是 real 但 minor factor (4.5pp/17.4pp=26%)；information\\\\n    overload 是 VOTA 优势主因 (74%)\\\\n  rationale: full_trace label-only loss 86.2% vs 标准 loss 81.8%，提升 4.5pp 确认 gradient\\\\n    dilution 存在。但 86.2% vs VOTA 99.2% 仍有 13pp gap，只能通过 trace compression 弥补。因果分解：gradient\\\\n    dilution 贡献 ~26% (4.5/17.4pp)，information overload 贡献 ~74% (13.0/17.4pp)。VOTA\\\\n    的核心优势是信息质量（decision-relevant state selection），不仅是训练效率。这为 Claim 2 提供了定量支撑，可在论文中写\\\\\\\"Even\\\\n    with oracle loss masking, full traces still underperform VOTA by 13pp\\\\\\\"。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: full_trace_label_only_seed42\\\\n    role: plan_002 ablation\\\\n    result: 86.2% accuracy [84.4, 88.1]\\\\n  - exp_id: full_trace_seed42_v5\\\\n    role: 对照 (standard loss)\\\\n    result: 81.8%\\\\n  - exp_id: vota_seed42_v5\\\\n    role: 对照 (VOTA)\\\\n    result: 99.2%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D006\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 6667, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01WoQB7zaUMw2u55LZvwD1Mc","session_id":"f8be9c78-f712-42a3-a09c-05adddba0d90","uuid":"5b645200-95cb-4351-b737-63af7d7dd4f7","timestamp":"2026-05-15T09:35:00.801Z"}
