{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01LdYRbMK7JqJWdnN9NEVxpm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0186XZHPAyHhc6uuTXuM43xe","name":"SendMessage","input":{"to":"ab9de8fc96a44230d","message":"## Step 2: Cross-Sharing\n\nR2 (Novelty & Related Work) has completed their review. Here are their key findings. Please respond with:\n1. Which of R2's points you agree/disagree with\n2. Whether any of R2's observations change your assessment\n3. Any points you want to emphasize or adjust\n\n### R2's Review (Score: 3/6, Confidence: 4/5)\n\n**Key Strengths R2 identified:**\n- Well-defined research question with clean experimental design\n- Honest reframing of VOTA as error signal extraction\n- Gradient dilution vs information overload decomposition is a nice methodological idea\n- Task-dependency finding on DebugBench is the most novel result\n\n**Key Weaknesses R2 identified:**\n1. (Major) Core finding borders on obvious — that error/exception signals dominate pass/fail prediction is unsurprising\n2. (Major) Chen et al. 2022 citation is misattributed — arXiv:2107.03374 is Codex/HumanEval, not test outcome prediction\n3. (Major) Extremely narrow scope — 2 tasks, 2 models, 1 language, small datasets\n4. (Major) Related work has significant gaps — only 8 references, many relevant papers missing (NExT, APPT, TraceCoder, Ferrando et al., etc.)\n5. (Minor) Super-additive synergy overclaimed\n6. (Minor) Dataset construction opaque\n7. (Minor) LIMA citation is a stretch for \"information density\"\n\n**Missing Related Work R2 identified:**\n- NExT (Ni et al. ICML 2024), APPT (TSE 2024), TraceCoder (ICSE 2026), Ferrando et al. 2025, Haque et al. (KnowledgeNLP @ ACL 2025), ET-CoT/PyTracify, Code Execution as Grounded Supervision\n\nPlease provide your cross-sharing response (keep it concise, focus on agreements/disagreements/adjustments)."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7859,"cache_read_input_tokens":53382,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7859},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f8be9c78-f712-42a3-a09c-05adddba0d90","uuid":"27003595-b77a-4c95-99eb-90f5390d4180"}
